+++ b/README_GOLDEN_PATH.md
@@ -0,0 +1,143 @@
+# Aegis Golden Path (v1)
+
+Implements the minimal end-to-end platform loop:
+
+1) Register model artifact → store in S3/MinIO → sign → record
+2) Approve + eval pass → deploy (vLLM/Triton) into tenant namespace
+3) Inference gateway routes → meters usage → writes audit events
+4) All enforced by OIDC roles + tenant_id scoping
+
+## Run (API)
+
+```bash
+uvicorn api.main_golden:app --reload
+```
+
+## Bootstrap DB (first run)
+
+```bash
+python -m api.bootstrap_golden_db
+```
+
+## Required env vars
+
+### Auth (OIDC JWKS)
+- `OIDC_JWKS_URI` (required)
+- `OIDC_AUDIENCE` (recommended)
+- `OIDC_ISSUER` (recommended)
+- `AEGIS_TENANT_CLAIM` (default: `tenant`)
+- `AEGIS_ROLES_CLAIM` (default: `roles`)
+
+Role suggestions:
+- `platform_admin`
+- `tenant_admin`
+- `tenant_developer`
+- `tenant_user`
+
+### Storage (AWS S3 or MinIO)
+- `AEGIS_ARTIFACTS_BUCKET` (required)
+- `AEGIS_S3_REGION` (default `us-east-1`)
+- `AEGIS_S3_ENDPOINT_URL` (optional)
+
+AWS S3:
+- do not set `AEGIS_S3_ENDPOINT_URL`
+
+MinIO in-cluster:
+- set `AEGIS_S3_ENDPOINT_URL=http://minio.<namespace>.svc:9000`
+
+### Signing (dev/test)
+- `AEGIS_SIGN_MODE=hmac|noop`
+- `AEGIS_SIGN_HMAC_SECRET=...`
+
+## Kubernetes config
+- `AEGIS_K8S_CONFIG=auto|incluster|kubeconfig`
+
+## Inference proxying
+The gateway can optionally forward to the in-cluster service:
+- `AEGIS_INFER_PROXY_ENABLED=true`
+- `AEGIS_INFER_PROXY_TIMEOUT_S=10`
+
+## Golden path API calls (high level)
+1. Upsert tenant (platform admin):
+   POST /v1/admin/tenants/upsert
+2. Create project:
+   POST /v1/projects
+3. Create model:
+   POST /v1/models
+4. Register model version (upload):
+   POST /v1/registry/register
+5. Set eval pass:
+   POST /v1/registry/{model_version_id}/eval
+6. Approve:
+   POST /v1/registry/{model_version_id}/approve
+7. Deploy:
+   POST /v1/deployments
+8. Infer:
+   POST /v1/infer
